  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-tiny-tomatoes-v6-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "4304fe382dc0d138f1a09c16a3d170b6386adf8273beabb4f3feb65e9efbc5e8",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aedaf1078a686c2a503ba5022fe5058c05d5c52fd403e877da38fcff1baea59b",
      "text": "悟空的\n小番茄",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0ff2263f01ce0b76a70709e0bc6b732830bbd6b89a953d9bb5ab865ac717e1f2",
      "text": "悟空家门口，\n有块阳光暖暖的小空地。\n“我们来种小番茄吧！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "da7fd287b1e1ec03dba81c3752dc1ee3a81b4990d9821e82f326dd1c7883ed78",
      "text": "敖丙带来两棵小苗。\n他们挖了两个小坑。\n“你种一棵，我种一棵！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2f2b80120b84f9bc634e5740fa173798b4c7180a7d85e09dbd4b004366cd3e05",
      "text": "把小苗放进坑里，盖好土。\n悟空拍拍土，\n又拍拍自己的小肚子。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "936654fa9e3490ccb9c9bc29653eac728ccffc9a07bca4469d0dfd34c48efe12",
      "text": "悟空提起小水壶。\n“小苗，喝水喽！”\n哎呀，先把鞋子浇湿了！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "de753e151a32a24e360c72b136d11acff6643b555a0e791b34c11e0262f0cc7c",
      "text": "敖丙变出一朵小云。\n滴答滴答，小雨落下来。\n“这回，小苗喝到水啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "66f83495d996126faf352fbca1f1df2ccfacdd0b2875d6b7fafda597a896da60",
      "text": "每天，他们都摸摸泥土。\n土干了？浇一点水。\n土湿湿的？放心去玩吧！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6cca9909f51b55c73084dcd8de613b89f663808693e4295063eefea7828d42fe",
      "text": "“红了吗？”悟空问。\n他在每片叶子下面找呀找。\n敖丙指指他的小鼻子，笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7d725414e139b2a4649193d8512835cfd13dfac32ae05ed63f1cffce19b18326",
      "text": "一天天过去了。\n小黄花开了。\n“你好呀，小星星！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aaa2575bbc2fa81e8a2c811e6d7894b0a47d69be9851494d0170f7bdef3a8b1c",
      "text": "接着，长出绿绿的小番茄。\n“熟了吗？”悟空问。\n“还没有呢。”敖丙说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "090ce085c26e4f70205d5fdf760830da87c1287259296b03a11e5d74f6178433",
      "text": "悟空小声说：\n“请变红吧。”\n番茄静悄悄的，\n一声也不吭。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9ecea1e3ae7c7c5583a1bfde17c0b5fdfce6982b48f7614d08bf0c33eb8e5334",
      "text": "浇浇水，等一等。\n绿的变黄，黄的变橙。\n“就快熟啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "efde2b406c0118259fe7bf743df88b8575b42ba108d278c79aac1a02e6061269",
      "text": "一天早上，番茄红啦！\n红得亮晶晶的。\n悟空乐得跳起舞来。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "988d54d3f5c7a51b89668deb4ec4e6ef131e0851c7ec1d4b01fe4f209cc5b35b",
      "text": "轻轻一拧，往上一提。\n红番茄摘下来啦！\n绿番茄留着继续长。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3f29256c4e920f3699e7b059c19f2eb70ad5d0e9235675ed0b2fe4a9a80f4193",
      "text": "他们洗净刚摘的小番茄。\n红红的番茄，凉凉的水。\n“现在可以尝尝啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f6416d5787aa87553c1f9241107e10f952dbeab84ac2b7f7330d99941c7f29a6",
      "text": "他们分着吃小番茄。\n“这是我们种的！”悟空说。\n敖丙笑了：“我们一起种的。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
